00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:47.140
What's going on down there?

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:50.220
How about we go do something
on the way back?

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:52.890
Well, I don't really have any
money on me today...

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:55.250
Actually, I'd like to have
a little word with you.

00:14:57.530 --> 00:14:59.320
So that's how it's going to be, eh?

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:03.130
Um, I don't know what Hild might have done,

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:06.860
but I'll be happy to hear you out,
so would you mind putting that down?

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:08.470
Keiichi...

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:13.340
You don't need to get involved in this.
Go on ahead of me.

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:15.280
I'll be done with this real quick.

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:16.480
But...

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:17.810
Go.

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:19.180
Hild...

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:21.450
You leave me no choice then.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:31.150
And I was just starting to get bored.

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:34.750
I'll owe you some praise if you can
last five minutes against me!

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:39.360
Not bad.

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:43.830
Try not to underestimate me too much,
or you're gonna get hurt!

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:48.470
The brakes aren't working! Crap!

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:01.880
Are you all right, Keiichi?

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:05.220
"Keiichi"?

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:07.400
Oh, sorry...

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:10.100
I was just surprised to hear you call me by
my first name, even though we just met...

00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:11.930
I'm sorry.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:15.970
It's okay, don't worry about it!

00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:17.840
Um, actually...

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:20.730
I...

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:24.550
Um... You see...

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:29.210
I... I...

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:32.020
Keiichi, I...

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:32.750
Keiichi!
Keiichi, I...

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:33.740
Keiichi!

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.280
Oh, hey, Hild.

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:41.900
Hey, whaddya think you're doing out here
talking to some OTHER girl?

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:43.630
Well, I fell off the bike...

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:46.230
No way! Are you all right?

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:55.010
Sorry, Belldandy. The ruler of demonkind
was too strong for me...

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:58.050
Hild, not while she's watching.

00:16:58.050 --> 00:17:01.280
Why not say it? How you really feel...

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:03.440
How I really feel?

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:07.060
Right. You hate me, don't you?

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:11.010
For taking your lover from you,
and taking him in my arms.

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:16.100
And playing with him however I like...

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:18.590
Whoa, hold on...

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:21.230
A little boy, like this...

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:26.110
Hild...

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:27.740
Hold still, now.

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:28.830
NO!

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:38.440
Yes, that's what I'm talking about.

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:41.780
These are your true feelings.

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:43.780
And power.

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:47.190
Release the feelings you have now.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.630
Feelings I have now...

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:52.900
Hatred, anger, jealousy...

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:56.670
Hit me with all of those feelings.

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:58.160
I...

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:01.040
That will bring Keiichi back to you.

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:04.940
You can have him all to yourself.
Come now, show me!

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:14.650
I... I...

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:19.090
Release them all! Along with all that power!

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:21.790
I!

00:18:23.430 --> 00:18:25.900
Do you like the snow?

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:28.300
I do.

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:34.030
It's so pure and white, and it kind of
makes me feel at ease somehow.

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:40.140
I think it suits you really well, too.

00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:45.350
It's "diamond dust"!

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:48.120
Pretty, isn't it?

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:52.320
Yes!

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:56.320
Why?

00:18:57.230 --> 00:18:58.860
Unbelievable.

00:18:59.270 --> 00:19:00.560
Hild...

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:04.460
There's something I need to talk to you about.

00:19:07.280 --> 00:19:08.900
See ya!

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:14.850
Oh! Big Sister?

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.810
Big Sister!

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:18.690
Skuld...

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:20.920
What are you doing out here?

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:28.760
I... I've... done something I
probably shouldn't have.

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:30.320
What happened?

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:33.360
Oh, Skuld...

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:37.600
Big Sister?

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:49.620
Why?

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:53.950
Well, because you don't really like me, right?

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:59.530
How could a mere human
like him have realized?

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:01.430
That's Keiichi for you.

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:03.860
Urd?

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:08.670
If it were for Belldandy's sake,
he'd place a call straight to Heaven,

00:20:08.670 --> 00:20:14.210
dare to fight against demons,
and go anywhere without fear.

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:16.210
That's the kind of guy he is.

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:21.920
What a bummer. I was hoping I'd see
Belldandy's true feelings come out.

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:24.050
What, they aren't obvious to you?

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:26.650
Her true feelings are easy to see!

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:27.620
Huh?

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:30.410
Her true feelings are...

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:42.700
Um... Belldandy?

00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:46.000
Yes?

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:50.970
Would you... like to go visit
the museum with me?

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:56.570
No?

00:21:00.260 --> 00:21:01.590
Yes!

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:03.090
In five years!

00:21:03.090 --> 00:21:04.180
Huh?

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:17.870
Huh? What am I doing here?

00:21:20.110 --> 00:21:22.080
In five years?

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:24.610
What's that supposed to mean?

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:29.080
Takagi...

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:31.590
Huh? Where's Big Sister?

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:34.350
She went out with Keiichi.

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:37.820
Don't bother them.

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:40.560
At least not for today.

00:21:49.140 --> 00:21:51.230
Amazing!

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:54.770
I wonder what color it was.

00:21:55.010 --> 00:21:59.410
I believe these were orange.

00:21:59.550 --> 00:22:01.610
Ah, is that right?

00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:09.310
What, do you like the snow?

00:22:10.290 --> 00:22:11.390
Yes.

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:15.290
Then why don't we go visit
my hometown next winter?

00:22:18.170 --> 00:22:19.630
What's the matter?

00:22:22.100 --> 00:22:23.330
You bet!

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:34.850
Ichinichi oeru tabi

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:47.830
"Kyou mo anata no koto daisuki deshita" to
sotto mune ni omou

00:22:47.830 --> 00:22:51.970
Omoikaeseba hora

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:57.340
Nakitsukareta hi mo atta keredo

00:22:57.340 --> 00:23:06.180
Sonna yoru o ikutsu mo koete
tadoritsuita basho

00:23:06.180 --> 00:23:10.590
Soshite maku aketa story

00:23:10.590 --> 00:23:16.890
Nandaka yume mitai na real

00:23:16.890 --> 00:23:25.170
Sukoshi terewarainagara mo tsunaida te wa

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:35.740
Kitto kazoekirenu hodo no
ai no yokan ga afuredashite iru

00:23:35.740 --> 00:23:45.220
Datte magire mo naku hoka de
mo nai anata to atashi wa

00:23:45.220 --> 00:23:50.250
Koibito doushi na no

00:23:55.930 --> 00:23:58.590
A long forgotten promise.

00:23:58.930 --> 00:24:02.700
But she remembers, hoping that
it might come true some day.

00:24:03.340 --> 00:24:04.710
Next time: "Ah! Everyone Has a Destiny!"

00:24:04.710 --> 00:24:06.340
Ah! Everyone Has a Destiny!
Next time: "Ah! Everyone Has a Destiny!"

00:24:06.340 --> 00:24:09.340
Ah! Everyone Has a Destiny!
You've waited for me all this time, haven't you?

00:24:09.340 --> 00:24:09.640
Ah! Everyone Has a Destiny!
